---
// src/components/home/Hero.astro
---
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-txt">
    <div class="eyebrow">不動產登記・繼承・贈與</div>
    <h1>
      <span class="line l1"><span class="line-inner">產權的事，</span></span>
      <span class="line l2"><span class="line-inner"><mark>白紙黑字</mark>才算數。</span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">房子過戶、繼承、贈與——法律只認登記不認口頭。中友地政士事務所——三位地政士的代書世家，把複雜的手續講成人話，每一步替你把關。</p>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn dark" href="#contact">預約諮詢</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#col">看法律專欄</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="portrait" id="pt">
    <img src="/portrait-placeholder.svg" alt="蔡峻豪地政士形象照" width="300" height="380" />
  </div>
  <div class="watermark" id="wm">中友代書</div>
</header>

<style>
.hero{min-height:100svh; position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;
  align-items:center; padding:0 5vw; overflow:hidden}
.hero-txt{position:relative; z-index:2; padding-top:60px}
.eyebrow{font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.32em; color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:22px;
  opacity:0}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6.2vw,76px); line-height:1.24; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.01em; text-wrap:balance}
.line{overflow:hidden}
.line-inner{display:block; transform:translateY(112%)}
.l2 mark{background:none; color:inherit; box-shadow:inset 0 -0.22em var(--gold-tint)}
.hero .sub{color:var(--sub); font-size:16px; max-width:29em; margin:26px 0 34px; opacity:0}
.btns{display:flex; gap:14px; opacity:0; flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block; padding:15px 38px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.1em;
  text-decoration:none; transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1), box-shadow .25s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn.dark{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper)}
.btn.dark:hover{box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(21,23,28,.25)}
.btn.ghost{border:1.5px solid #C9C6BD; color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold); color:var(--gold-dark)}
.portrait{position:relative; z-index:2; align-self:end; opacity:0; transform:translateY(50px);
  will-change:transform}
.portrait img{display:block; width:100%; max-height:78svh}
.watermark{position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:-4vw; z-index:1; font-weight:900;
  font-size:clamp(90px,17vw,240px); letter-spacing:.02em; color:#F2F0EB; white-space:nowrap;
  line-height:1; pointer-events:none; will-change:transform; text-align:center}

@media (max-width:780px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr; align-items:start; padding-top:80px}
  .portrait{max-width:66%; margin:0 auto}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  /* 勿刪：motion.ts 的降級分支不含 .eyebrow/.hero .sub/.btns/.portrait，這裡是 reduced-motion 下唯一可見性來源 */
  .eyebrow,.line-inner,.hero .sub,.btns,.portrait{animation:none; opacity:1; transform:none}
}
</style>
